    <p style="font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.75">
      Looking for an <strong>experienced robotic knee replacement surgeon in Ahmedabad</strong>? The orthopedic team at <strong>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</strong> &mdash; led by <strong>Dr. Hardik Shah</strong> (Medical Director, MS Orthopedic, FRCS Germany) and <strong>Dr. Swagat Shah</strong> (FIAAS UK) &mdash; has successfully performed <strong>2,000+ knee replacement surgeries</strong> (robotic and conventional) and now offers <strong>VELYS robotic-assisted knee replacement</strong> from Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes: an imageless platform with sub-millimetre precision, no pre-operative CT scan, and the proven J&amp;J Attune knee implant.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:.96rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px">
      Located at 18 Sunrise Park Society, Vastrapur Lake &mdash; Drive-In Link Road, Gurukul, the DHS robotic surgery programme is easily reachable from <strong>Vastrapur, Gurukul, Drive-In, Satellite, Bodakdev, Memnagar, Thaltej, Sabarmati and Naranpura</strong>. Cashless treatment is available with most major Indian health insurers. Beyond robotic-assisted surgery, the same team also handles general <a href="/orthopedic-surgeon-ahmedabad/">orthopedic surgery in Ahmedabad</a>, sports medicine, trauma and spine.
    </p>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px">
